# Manual tests for ms-places (VS Code "REST Client" or Rider/Visual Studio).
# 1) Log in with ms-iam and paste the accessToken below (it lasts 1 hour).
@host = http://localhost:3002
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@placeId = PASTE_A_PLACE_ID_HERE

### HU-010 — my places (the selected one first; [] = the app shows "create your first place")
GET {{host}}/api/places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### HU-009 — create a place (the first one becomes the selected one)
POST {{host}}/api/places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityId": "PASTE_A_CITY_ID",
  "name": "Casa",
  "type": "RESIDENTIAL",
  "address": "Cra 7 # 12-34"
}

### HU-010 — select a place (remembered in the database, survives logout)
PUT {{host}}/api/places/{{placeId}}/default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### HU-011 — edit
PUT {{host}}/api/places/{{placeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityId": "PASTE_A_CITY_ID",
  "name": "Casa principal",
  "type": "RESIDENTIAL",
  "address": "Cra 7 # 12-34",
  "measurementUnit": "LITERS"
}

### HU-011 — delete (204; 409 place.has_active_device if a device is linked)
DELETE {{host}}/api/places/{{placeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revocation: after POST /api/auth/logout in ms-iam, this must answer 401
GET {{host}}/api/places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
